{
  "name": "Shield Maiden",
  "type": "character",
  "img": "systems/heroic5e/assets/characters/shield-maiden/Portrait-Shield-Maiden.png",
  "system": {
    "biography": "Alexandra Mercer — Shield Maiden\n\n“The Last Defender”\n\nClass: Bruiser\nOrigin: Mystic\nCalling: Protector\nSide: Heroic\n\nDescription Shield Maiden is a living embodiment of mythic heroism. After discovering an ancient relic shield tied to a forgotten protector spirit, Alexandra was transformed into a superhuman warrior possessing immense strength, resilience, and battlefield instincts. Rather than becoming distant or godlike, however, she chose to dedicate herself to protecting ordinary people from the violence consuming the city. In combat, Shield Maiden serves as the team’s frontline powerhouse: charging into danger, shielding allies from harm, and physically holding the line against threats that would overwhelm almost anyone else. She feels larger than life in the classic comic-book sense: a warrior hero who inspires people simply by standing her ground. Personality Fearless, passionate, protective, and emotionally direct. Alexandra possesses tremendous confidence and physical presence, but she is not arrogant or cruel. She believes strength exists to protect others, not dominate them. Despite her intimidating appearance, she connects easily with ordinary people and has a natural instinct for leadership and encouragement. Powers Shield Maiden possesses superhuman strength, durability, speed, reflexes, and enhanced combat instincts. She excels in close-quarters combat, battlefield disruption, shockwave strikes, powerful leaps, and physically intercepting attacks meant for allies or civilians. All granted by her magical shield.",
    "notes": "Combat Reference\nPower Die: d8\nProwess: +2\nTrained Saves: STR, CON.\nTrained Skills: Athletics, Intimidation, Medicine, Occult, Streetwise.\nClass & Strength EV (STR): 15",
